   * buffer), so PUTAREA may hand over arbitrarily large contiguous
   * areas (e.g. a whole preview frame in one call) without ever
   * overflowing the working buffer.  CS stays asserted across chunk
   * boundaries, so the panel remains in RAMWR. */
    for (i = 0; i < count; i++)
